==Points of Interest==
===Hidden Chamber===
After completing the [[Ruins of Alph Puzzle]], the player will be able to access the Hidden Chamber in the basement.

====Hidden Power Move Tutor====
By interacting with the stone table on the left side of the chamber, the player can teach [[bulbapedia:Hidden Power (move)|Hidden Power]] to their Pokémon.

====Changing Hidden Power Type====
By placing one of [[Arceus Plates Locations|Arceus's elemental plates]] into the basket on the right, the player can change the [[bulbapedia:type|type]] of one of their Pokémon's Hidden Power move.

